<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets bond interest rate at 29.28 pct.</title>
<headline>Russia sets bond interest rate at 29.28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will pay an annual interest rate of 29.28 percent in interest for the fifth coupon of the two-year OFZ interest-bearing bond (series 24006) maturing on February 4, 1998, the Central Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>			  fifth coupon		    fourth coupon</p>
<p>    percent	    29.28			     47.09</p>
<p>    roubles	    72,999			   117,402</p>
<p>    payment date    May 7, 1997		     Feb 5, 1997</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
